   216	    - Detect which direction forms the unique larger eligible parallel family.
   217	    - Use the family member at the median perpendicular offset as the reference extent.
   218	    - Clear only that family from the grid, then redraw every non-reference member so its start matches the reference start and its length matches the reference length.
   219	    - Do not redraw the reference itself, and leave all off-direction distractors untouched.
   220	
   221	    Key insight:
   222	    The operative structure is the larger parallel stack, not every visible line; its middle member defines an invisible target interval that the other members snap to before that middle line disappears.
